{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAFgeiUrsTDyfuAvHTyN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed it: when a handler panics with `http.ErrAbortHandler`, the recovery middleware no longer logs a \"panic recovered\" stack trace or sends a 500. It now treats that panic the same way it treats broken-pipe and connection-reset errors.\n\n- **What changed:** I added 3 lines to `recovery.go`. If the panic value is `http.ErrAbortHandler` (or wraps it), it's handled as a broken connection. That means one short log line with the request dump, the error added to `c.Errors`, and the request aborted.\n- **Test:** I added `TestPanicWithAbortHandler` to `recovery_test.go`. Before the fix it failed because the server returned a 500 and logged a stack trace. After the fix it passes. I also removed the fix temporarily and confirmed the test fails again without it.\n- **Checks:** `go test ./...` passes in every package, and `go vet` and `gofmt` are clean. The diff is 27 added lines across those two files.\n- **Visible behaviour change:** recovery functions passed to `CustomRecovery` are no longer called for this panic, which matches how broken pipes already work. This is the main thing to know before merging.\n- **Not done:**\n  - I didn't re-panic so Go's HTTP server handles the abort itself (silently dropping the connection). That would be closer to what `net/http` intends, but every middleware further up the chain would see the panic, so it's a bigger change.\n  - Nothing is committed yet. Say if you want it committed under `fix(recover): suppress http.ErrAbortHandler in recover`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":824,"cache_read_input_tokens":38612,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":824,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99bbd664-a782-4d49-a9c7-20b763a59c67","uuid":"aef91c37-3c54-4b16-add3-c4da6e8c15ba","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:27:55.614Z","request_id":"req_011CgAFgeV5xV1mjT6o2FcmL"}
